Package: quorum
Title: The Orchestra's Consensus Layer: Lenses In, a Typed Verdict Out
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Max", "Moldovan", email = "max.moldovan@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9680-8474"))
Description: The consensus layer of the Crop Analytics Orchestra. Registers
    any member's estimate of a shared estimand as a lens with declared
    independence, expressiveness and scope; compares a quorum of lenses with
    the hub's agreement semantics; resolves the comparison through a declared
    policy into a typed verdict and an orchestra manifest. A quorum of
    independent lenses must agree before an answer is carried, and no quorum
    means abstain. Carries the on-ramps by which non-hub estimates become
    lenses: ensemble-source ingestion, surrogate emulators of expensive fits,
    ensemble-derived priors, posterior predictive checks for surrogates, and
    the koine fourth-opinion backend. Depends on 'flexyBayes' for the core
    model representation and emits results in the same shapes.
